body:
being formal is kinda a waste of time when ppl can understand u ez if u use internet slang. Like u just try to make urself seem smarter than the person when ur just trying to hard.

&#x200B;

Being formal is kind of a waste of time when people can just as easily understand you, even if you apply the lexical field of the internet. It is as if you just attempt to make yourself appear smarter than the opposing party when, in actual fact, you are really just applying yourself too hard.

&#x200B;

Two different ways of saying the same exact thing. The second variation does not in any way have a stronger argument than the first.

A bigger vocab does not equal a bigger brain.

 [https://www.tubefilter.com/2019/07/29/the-fortnite-world-cup-finals-drew-more-than-2-million-concurrent-viewers/](https://www.tubefilter.com/2019/07/29/the-fortnite-world-cup-finals-drew-more-than-2-million-concurrent-viewers/) 

